      "source": "WCAG 2.2 SC 4.1.2 Name, Role, Value; WAI-ARIA 1.2 aria-owns (\"An element's ID MUST NOT be specified in more than one other element's aria-owns attribute at any time\")",
      "applicability": "Elements in the accessibility tree with aria-owns.",
      "expectation": "Fails when an id already owned by one element's aria-owns appears in another element's\naria-owns; the owner is then undetermined. Reported once, at the second owner. Owners of distinct ids\npass. Hidden owners are out of scope; ids compare within one tree (document or shadow root).",
